{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"860204853145501776","content":"(This is a chat where the DMs can talk to a player's spirit.  The player will not be able to read the message history here, so grant the player in question the permission to use this chat so you can talk to them, and then remove said permission when they have been brought back.  This can also be used for any other DM-Player, hidden from the rest of the player base conversations, for instance when I am damning people.\n\nThese track as IC channels, due to many of the events that happen here will blend OOC and IC)","created_at":"2021-07-01T17:08:34.288000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"860205253555519518","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"D (they/them)","id":"692746345387130900","is_bot":0,"username":"nonbianarydarry"},"author_id":"692746345387130900","channel_id":"860204853145501776","content":"<@809288447151439872> you find yourself in your body in a sitting room. Gaillardia, the dryad, sits there holding a cup of tea out for you.","created_at":"2021-07-15T03:42:19.173000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865075783734132777","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"D (they/them)","id":"692746345387130900","is_bot":0,"username":"nonbianarydarry"},"author_id":"692746345387130900","channel_id":"860204853145501776","content":"\"Come, sit. We have much to discuss.\"","created_at":"2021-07-15T03:42:31.749000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865075836483141712","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Siren","id":"809288447151439872","is_bot":0,"username":"sirenssong17"},"author_id":"809288447151439872","channel_id":"860204853145501776","content":"Paeton does as he is told, and takes the cup of tea, with a nod of appreciation. (Not saying thank you to a Fae!).","created_at":"2021-07-15T03:43:22.249000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865076048294838274","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"D (they/them)","id":"692746345387130900","is_bot":0,"username":"nonbianarydarry"},"author_id":"692746345387130900","channel_id":"860204853145501776","content":"\"I know this is a lot, but your material body is safe, your friends are gathering the necessary components for the spell, but the cost is up to you to pay.\"","created_at":"2021-07-15T03:44:38.518000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865076368190865439","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"D (they/them)","id":"692746345387130900","is_bot":0,"username":"nonbianarydarry"},"author_id":"692746345387130900","channel_id":"860204853145501776","content":"\"Is there anything you have to offer me?\"","created_at":"2021-07-15T03:45:30.182000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865076584885387275","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Siren","id":"809288447151439872","is_bot":0,"username":"sirenssong17"},"author_id":"809288447151439872","channel_id":"860204853145501776","content":"Paeton does not drink the tea, but he does welcome the warmth. \"It is a lot, but it is much better than I was expecting.\"","created_at":"2021-07-15T03:45:33.132000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865076597258453033","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Siren","id":"809288447151439872","is_bot":0,"username":"sirenssong17"},"author_id":"809288447151439872","channel_id":"860204853145501776","content":"\"I could offer to do a specified number of tasks for you, or every so often? Although, id prefer to hear your ideas, as well. I take it you've done this, many times before...\"","created_at":"2021-07-15T03:47:33.003000Z","edited_at":"2021-07-15T03:47:48.808000Z","id":"865077100032557056","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Siren","id":"809288447151439872","is_bot":0,"username":"sirenssong17"},"author_id":"809288447151439872","channel_id":"860204853145501776","content":"\"I'm not sure if this is an arrangement you would be interested in, but I could put myself in your service for even longer, in exchange for more power for myself (multiclass into warlock?)","created_at":"2021-07-15T03:52:23.785000Z","edited_at":"2021-07-15T03:52:36.566000Z","id":"865078319660662784","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
